WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
[Silent screen recording. There is no audio. Account and card details are blacked out.]

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The task: buy deskfish.sh for one year, no add-ons, and knock on the glass at Pay.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Deskfish opens Firefox in its own desktop and goes to Namecheap.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
It searches for deskfish.sh: available at $34.98 a year.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Add to cart, then the cart: one item, no add-ons, confirm order. The sign-in page.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:50.000
It signs in with the login saved in the browser's password manager.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Signed in. It reads the order review and the saved payment method.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:55.000
It knocks on the glass: the saved card looks expired. Its human takes the desk and enters another card.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:30.000
Back on the order review, it knocks again: everything is ready, press Pay. Its human presses Pay.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:04:09.000
Order confirmed. Deskfish reads the confirmation page and reports the total and the order number.
